2. End-to-end Databricks project
A good first real-time-style project is an E-commerce Sales Data Engineering Pipeline. It helps you practise most of the skills expected in a Databricks data engineer role.
Source systems
Customers · Orders · Products · Payments · CSV/JSON files
Bronze layer
Ingest raw data with minimal changes
Silver layer
Clean, validate, deduplicate and join data
Gold layer
Business metrics and aggregated tables
Reporting and consumption
Databricks SQL dashboards or Power BI
Project requirements
Process daily orders, customers, products and payments.
Store the raw data in the Bronze layer.
Clean invalid records and remove duplicates in Silver.
Calculate revenue, order counts and product performance in Gold.
Schedule the pipeline to run automatically.
Handle new data, failures and data quality issues.
Monitor the pipeline and control access to data.
